  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-052 (Phase 3 — engine / Flows (`HFRClient`) — fetch → parse → submit → classify ([ADR 0008](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/adr/0008-hfrclient-orchestration-module.md))): MPStorage transport (find, read, create, update; conflict-aware).\n\n### Scope\n\nMPStorage transport (find, read, create, update; conflict-aware)\n\n- Module: HFRClient · Difficulty: difficult · Priority: medium · ★ critical path\n- Audit source: D8\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-038 (#65), LOT-048 (#74), LOT-062 (#87)\n\n### Blocked by\n\nNothing: LOT-038 (#65), LOT-048 (#74) and LOT-062 (#87) are done, and the capture #132 is closed (updated 2026-10-31, unblocked by #351).\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-052-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\nNone recorded.\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#80](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/80) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-mpstorage-thread-its-first-post-page (#132)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked`.\n\n",
